WEBVTT

1
00:00:34.083 --> 00:00:35.000
After seeing Lord Krishna's

2
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.041
terrifying Vishwarupa,

3
00:00:38.041 --> 00:00:41.958
Arjun is filled with wonder and fear.

4
00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:44.208
He watches destruction unfolding before him

5
00:00:44.208 --> 00:00:46.250
and understands that this is not merely

6
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:48.250
a display of power.

7
00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:51.416
There is a deeper purpose behind it.

8
00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:52.916
Overwhelmed,

9
00:00:52.916 --> 00:00:55.916
he asks two important questions.

10
00:00:55.916 --> 00:00:57.333
Although Arjun

11
00:00:57.333 --> 00:00:58.041
knows Lord Krishna

12
00:00:58.041 --> 00:01:00.291
as the Supreme Lord,

13
00:01:00.291 --> 00:01:02.458
he still seeks clarity

14
00:01:02.458 --> 00:01:03.083
on why Lord Krishna

15
00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:05.875
is showing this particular form.

16
00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:07.000
He bows humbly

17
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.750
and begs Lord Krishna for mercy,

18
00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:11.666
while also

19
00:01:11.666 --> 00:01:15.916
requesting an explanation of this form.

20
00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:23.666
In verse 11.31 of the eleventh chapter,

21
00:01:23.666 --> 00:01:26.833
it is described that Arjun,
seeing Lord Krishna's vast

22
00:01:26.833 --> 00:01:29.333
and destructive form,

23
00:01:29.333 --> 00:01:31.791
is completely shaken.

24
00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.208
Until now, he had known
Lord Krishna as his friend,

25
00:01:34.208 --> 00:01:38.041
guide, and charioteer,

26
00:01:38.041 --> 00:01:39.500
but this vision

27
00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:43.125
shows a different aspect of His divinity.

28
00:01:43.125 --> 00:01:44.291
The one who, Himself

29
00:01:44.291 --> 00:01:48.833
as time, consumes all living beings.

30
00:01:48.833 --> 00:01:52.916
Now he cannot grasp the
purpose behind this vision.

31
00:01:52.916 --> 00:01:58.000
So, with deep humility, he asks,

32
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.541
'Who are You in this terrifying form?'

33
00:02:02.541 --> 00:02:06.208
'Why are You showing this fierce form?

34
00:02:06.208 --> 00:02:10.125
What is Your purpose behind it?'

35
00:02:10.125 --> 00:02:13.125
Although Arjun has faith in Lord Krishna,

36
00:02:13.125 --> 00:02:16.208
to understand this divine revelation

37
00:02:16.208 --> 00:02:19.250
he is experiencing difficulty.

38
00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:23.250
He understands that this is not just a vision,

39
00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:27.416
it is a message, but his curiosity is

40
00:02:27.416 --> 00:02:29.791
what that message is.

41
00:02:29.791 --> 00:02:33.208
Arjun, humbly expecting mercy,

42
00:02:33.208 --> 00:02:35.125
bows in surrender.

43
00:02:35.125 --> 00:02:38.416
He understands that Lord Krishna never, without

44
00:02:38.416 --> 00:02:40.833
a purpose, does anything,

45
00:02:40.833 --> 00:02:44.083
and so he waits for the answer.

46
00:02:44.083 --> 00:02:47.166
He is ready and eager to listen and learn.

47
00:02:47.166 --> 00:02:48.916
In the next verse, Lord Krishna

48
00:02:48.916 --> 00:02:51.875
will answer Arjun's questions.

49
00:02:56.458 --> 00:02:58.541
Notice this in yourself.

50
00:02:58.541 --> 00:03:01.666
When a very difficult problem

51
00:03:01.666 --> 00:03:04.875
suddenly comes before you,

52
00:03:04.875 --> 00:03:07.583
do you panic,

53
00:03:07.583 --> 00:03:10.166
or do you patiently

54
00:03:10.166 --> 00:03:13.791
think about how to solve it?

55
00:03:13.791 --> 00:03:15.833
When Arjun saw

56
00:03:15.833 --> 00:03:20.333
My terrifying Vishwarupa,

57
00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:21.958
he

58
00:03:21.958 --> 00:03:24.041
did not let fear

59
00:03:24.041 --> 00:03:26.708
overwhelm him.

60
00:03:26.708 --> 00:03:28.500
Instead,

61
00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:31.916
he composed himself

62
00:03:31.916 --> 00:03:35.791
and asked himself,

63
00:03:35.791 --> 00:03:38.333
'What is the purpose of this?

64
00:03:38.333 --> 00:03:41.791
What should I learn?'

65
00:03:41.791 --> 00:03:44.208
And he understood

66
00:03:44.208 --> 00:03:48.583
that whatever I do,

67
00:03:48.583 --> 00:03:53.166
it is not meaningless.

68
00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:55.166
Now this, for your life

69
00:03:55.166 --> 00:03:58.208
too, is a powerful lesson.

70
00:03:58.208 --> 00:04:00.291
Let us suppose, for some

71
00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:03.000
special task, while going to another city

72
00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:09.041
you find the road closed because of a flood.

73
00:04:09.041 --> 00:04:11.458
What will you do?

74
00:04:11.458 --> 00:04:14.916
In the rush to reach, will you,
try to take your vehicle across

75
00:04:14.916 --> 00:04:18.583
through the water- submerged bridge?

76
00:04:18.583 --> 00:04:23.375
Will you search for another safe route,

77
00:04:23.375 --> 00:04:25.833
or when reaching seems impossible,

78
00:04:25.833 --> 00:04:31.958
will you honestly explain
the reason to the concerned party,

79
00:04:31.958 --> 00:04:39.291
leave the outcome to Me,
and postpone the journey?

80
00:04:39.291 --> 00:04:43.916
Many such situations arise every day.

81
00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:45.291
Taking lessons from past experiences,

82
00:04:45.291 --> 00:04:49.500
preparing solidly for what lies ahead,

83
00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:54.541
and even after full effort,

84
00:04:54.541 --> 00:04:57.083
leaving the final result to me.

85
00:04:57.083 --> 00:05:01.041
saves you from unnecessary worry and stress.

86
00:05:01.041 --> 00:05:05.125
When you face failures, successes,

87
00:05:05.125 --> 00:05:09.291
or unexpected challenges,

88
00:05:09.291 --> 00:05:11.375
it is easy to feel disheartened

89
00:05:11.375 --> 00:05:14.458
or to think that

90
00:05:14.458 --> 00:05:18.083
life is unfair.

91
00:05:18.083 --> 00:05:19.666
But

92
00:05:19.666 --> 00:05:22.375
instead of thinking

93
00:05:22.375 --> 00:05:25.000
'Why did this happen?',

94
00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:28.041
ask yourself,

95
00:05:28.041 --> 00:05:32.250
'What is the purpose of this experience?

96
00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:33.958
What is life

97
00:05:33.958 --> 00:05:37.958
trying to teach me?'

98
00:05:37.958 --> 00:05:39.833
Every challenge

99
00:05:39.833 --> 00:05:42.416
comes with a lesson.

100
00:05:42.416 --> 00:05:47.291
Whether it is to build resilience,
to teach patience,

101
00:05:47.291 --> 00:05:51.458
or to help deepen your compassion.

102
00:05:51.458 --> 00:05:52.791
Difficult moments are often

103
00:05:52.791 --> 00:05:55.791
steps of learning.

104
00:05:55.791 --> 00:05:59.541
They take you to the heights of experience.

105
00:05:59.541 --> 00:06:02.458
When you, with this mindset,

106
00:06:02.458 --> 00:06:06.625
face life's adverse situations,

107
00:06:06.625 --> 00:06:08.666
then challenges no longer feel like suffering

108
00:06:08.666 --> 00:06:11.708
or punishment.

109
00:06:11.708 --> 00:06:15.833
They become opportunities for growth.

110
00:06:15.833 --> 00:06:17.875
Trust

111
00:06:17.875 --> 00:06:20.125
that even in difficult times

112
00:06:20.125 --> 00:06:22.750
there is a purpose,

113
00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:27.041
one that helps you become a stronger, wiser,

114
00:06:27.041 --> 00:06:32.416
and more compassionate person.

115
00:06:36.833 --> 00:06:38.541
Think about this,

116
00:06:38.541 --> 00:06:41.458
if one day father, coming home from the office,

117
00:06:41.458 --> 00:06:44.750
behaves irritably,

118
00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:49.500
or the children speak very rudely,

119
00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:52.083
then what is the rest of the family

120
00:06:52.083 --> 00:06:55.708
members' reaction?

121
00:06:55.708 --> 00:06:58.416
In family life, often

122
00:06:58.416 --> 00:07:01.708
misunderstandings arise because

123
00:07:01.708 --> 00:07:04.333
people, the feelings behind the words,

124
00:07:04.333 --> 00:07:08.500
instead of understanding, to what was said

125
00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:11.416
react immediately.

126
00:07:11.416 --> 00:07:15.833
Just as Arjun saw My Vishwarupa

127
00:07:15.833 --> 00:07:19.625
and, instead of reacting from fear, asked,

128
00:07:19.625 --> 00:07:21.750
'What is the purpose of this?',

129
00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.666
you too should ask,

130
00:07:24.666 --> 00:07:28.208
'Why is this person speaking this way

131
00:07:28.208 --> 00:07:31.708
or behaving like this?'

132
00:07:31.708 --> 00:07:36.166
When a cheerful father
suddenly seems irritable,

133
00:07:36.166 --> 00:07:40.750
or a calm- natured child suddenly seems angry,

134
00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:42.250
then know this.

135
00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:44.833
Certainly, in their life, something

136
00:07:44.833 --> 00:07:48.333
unpleasant is happening.

137
00:07:48.333 --> 00:07:49.625
In such times,

138
00:07:49.625 --> 00:07:52.916
do not get annoyed or impatient with them, but

139
00:07:52.916 --> 00:07:56.958
listen to them with empathy.

140
00:07:56.958 --> 00:07:58.916
Be certain,

141
00:07:58.916 --> 00:08:02.000
their stress will come to an end,

142
00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.958
and their love

143
00:08:03.958 --> 00:08:06.958
and trust for you will grow.

144
00:08:06.958 --> 00:08:11.083
This behaviour of yours
connects the family deeply.

145
00:08:11.083 --> 00:08:13.875
Instead of criticising,

146
00:08:13.875 --> 00:08:16.208
by trying to understand,

147
00:08:16.208 --> 00:08:18.416
you create space for open communication

148
00:08:18.416 --> 00:08:21.500
and togetherness.

149
00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:23.000
This approach

150
00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:26.125
strengthens family bonds,

151
00:08:26.125 --> 00:08:27.875
because every member

152
00:08:27.875 --> 00:08:30.416
can express their thoughts

153
00:08:30.416 --> 00:08:32.000
and, within the family,

154
00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:35.083
experiences their own worth.

155
00:08:35.083 --> 00:08:37.708
Just as Arjun, what he saw,

156
00:08:37.708 --> 00:08:42.291
sought its deeper meaning,

157
00:08:42.291 --> 00:08:44.875
seek the deeper reason behind

158
00:08:44.875 --> 00:08:49.791
your loved ones' words and actions.

159
00:08:49.791 --> 00:08:51.833
Doing so, you will build a home

160
00:08:51.833 --> 00:08:54.750
filled with compassion

161
00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:56.416
and harmony.

162
00:09:01.208 --> 00:09:04.166
You know this well,

163
00:09:04.166 --> 00:09:10.750
challenges are an inseparable
part of work and business.

164
00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:14.000
Do they frighten you?

165
00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:15.625
What do you do

166
00:09:15.625 --> 00:09:19.500
when a difficult obstacle appears before you?

167
00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:22.250
Come, let us find out together

168
00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:26.541
what Arjun did when such a situation arose.

169
00:09:26.541 --> 00:09:29.083
In professional life, clarity

170
00:09:29.083 --> 00:09:32.958
often comes from asking the right questions.

171
00:09:32.958 --> 00:09:36.125
Just as Arjun, even while fearful,

172
00:09:36.125 --> 00:09:39.416
composed himself and, from Me,

173
00:09:39.416 --> 00:09:43.416
asked the purpose of My Vishwarupa,

174
00:09:43.416 --> 00:09:49.375
you too should develop the habit
of seeking clear reasons

175
00:09:49.375 --> 00:09:53.375
when facing confusion or uncertainty,

176
00:09:53.375 --> 00:09:57.000
Instead of reacting in agitation,

177
00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:00.083
pause and ask.

178
00:10:00.083 --> 00:10:03.125
'What is my goal here?

179
00:10:03.125 --> 00:10:07.625
What should I learn from this situation?'

180
00:10:07.625 --> 00:10:10.041
When tasks feel heavy,

181
00:10:10.041 --> 00:10:15.000
or a project takes an unexpected turn,

182
00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.458
then,

183
00:10:16.458 --> 00:10:19.041
'Why are we doing this?

184
00:10:19.041 --> 00:10:22.166
What is the expected outcome?

185
00:10:22.166 --> 00:10:27.708
How can I contribute more effectively?

186
00:10:27.708 --> 00:10:29.875
Asking such questions

187
00:10:29.875 --> 00:10:32.708
can help you face challenges

188
00:10:32.708 --> 00:10:36.500
with purpose.

189
00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:38.750
The right questions lead to solutions,

190
00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:40.166
better decisions,

191
00:10:40.166 --> 00:10:43.708
and better performance.

192
00:10:43.708 --> 00:10:46.416
Similarly, while working

193
00:10:46.416 --> 00:10:49.666
with others, asking,

194
00:10:49.666 --> 00:10:51.500
'What do you need?

195
00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:54.833
How can I help?'

196
00:10:54.833 --> 00:10:59.458
promotes cooperation and understanding.

197
00:10:59.458 --> 00:11:01.416
Just as Arjun, with humility,

198
00:11:01.416 --> 00:11:04.666
by asking, gained clear vision,

199
00:11:04.666 --> 00:11:08.000
you too, with curiosity, openness,

200
00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.583
and a willingness to learn,

201
00:11:10.583 --> 00:11:15.208
by seeking answers, can attain success.
